  "problem": "The total amount of money $M(t)$ in a charity’s fundraising account $t$ days after the first day of a campaign is given by the function\n\n$$\nM(t)=1500+{\\int }_{0}^{t}(3{x}^{2}-27)\\,\\text{d}x,\n$$\n\nwhere $M$ is measured in dollars, and $t\\ge 0$ is the time (in days) since the first day of the campaign.\n\nFind the time when the total amount is minimum, and how much money was in the account at that time.\n\nThe minimum amount is\n$$$\n{{field-1}}\nafter \n{{field-2}} days.",
